<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tirgum · Official letters explained in your language</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/tirgum-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+Ethiopic:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">


  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-[#F2F8F7] text-[#0B4F4A] font-['Inter_Tight','Noto_Sans_Ethiopic',sans-serif]">


  <header class="flex items-center justify-around gap-5 p-2.5 bg-white border-b border-[#e6e6e6]">
    <a href="/">
      <img src="/images/tirgum-logo.svg" alt="Tirgum" class="h-11 w-auto">
    </a>
    <nav>
      <ul class="flex items-center gap-[15px] m-0 p-0 list-none">
        <li><a href="#howitworks" class="p-2.5 rounded-[5px] no-underline hover:bg-[#E6F2F0]">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a href="#privacy" class="p-2.5 rounded-[5px] no-underline hover:bg-[#E6F2F0]">Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="p-2.5 rounded-[5px] no-underline hover:bg-[#E6F2F0]">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/login" class="p-2.5 font-medium no-underline">Log in</a></li>
        <li>
     
          <a href="/signup" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white font-medium no-underline hover:bg-[#0D5F59]">Create free account</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>


  <section class="max-w-[960px] w-full mx-auto my-[30px] px-5 py-[60px] text-center">
    <h1 class="text-[40px] md:text-[56px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#135550] m-0">
      Understand every official letter, in
      <em class="font-['Instrument_Serif',Georgia,serif] italic font-normal">your language.</em>
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-[460px] mx-auto my-5 text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal">
      Take a photo of a confusing letter. Tirgum explains what it means, when it's due, and what to do next, then points you to free help nearby.
    </p>

   
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-2">
      <a href="/signup" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#F2A541] text-[#0B4F4A] font-medium no-underline hover:brightness-95">Create free account</a>
      <a href="/sample" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white font-medium no-underline hover:bg-[#0D5F59]">See a sample letter</a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#6b6b6b]">  Your letter is never saved.</p>


    <div class="mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6] p-3 md:p-6">
      <img
        src="/images/tirgum-landing-hero.png"
        alt="Tirgum explaining a MassHealth renewal letter: upload screen, results page, and the same letter in Amharic"
        width="2000" height="1222"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="howitworks" class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 py-16 text-center">
    <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#0F766E]">How it works</span>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#135550]">
      From confusing to <em class="font-['Instrument_Serif',Georgia,serif] italic font-normal">clear</em> in three steps
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-5">
      <div class="w-full max-w-[350px] p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6] text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 mt-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold">1</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-medium">Take a photo</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal">Photograph your letter or upload a PDF. Any page, any sender.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full max-w-[350px] p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6] text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 mt-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold">2</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-medium">Know what it means</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal">A plain summary, the deadline, and a checklist of what to do.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full max-w-[350px] p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6] text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 mt-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold">3</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-medium">Get help if you need it</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal">Free local organizations that speak your language.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="privacy" class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6]">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#0F766E]">Privacy and trust</span>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#135550]">
          Built for <em class="font-['Instrument_Serif',Georgia,serif] italic font-normal">sensitive</em> letters
        </h2>
        <a href="/privacy" class="inline-block mt-4 font-medium underline">Read our privacy page →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <p class="text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal"><strong class="text-[#0B4F4A] font-semibold">Your letter image is never stored.</strong> We read it, explain it, and delete it.</p>
        <p class="text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal"><strong class="text-[#0B4F4A] font-semibold">You control your data.</strong> Delete any letter or your whole account anytime.</p>
        <p class="text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal"><strong class="text-[#0B4F4A] font-semibold">Not legal advice.</strong> For serious matters, we point you to free, trusted organizations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10 p-6 md:p-10 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#e6e6e6]">
      <img
        src="/images/dagi-800.webp"
        srcset="/images/dagi-400.webp 400w, /images/dagi-800.webp 800w"
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 320px, 100vw"
        width="800" height="1000"
        loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        alt="Dagmawi, founder of Tirgum"
        class="w-full max-w-[320px] aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-2xl">

      <div>
        <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#0F766E]">Why I built Tirgum</span>
        <p class="mt-4 text-2xl md:text-[32px] leading-snug font-['Instrument_Serif',Georgia,serif] text-[#135550]">
          "When my family moved to Boston, official letters were the hardest part. We'd send photos to friends and wait for someone to explain them. I built Tirgum so no family has to wait."
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-6 font-semibold"><span class="text-[#F2A541]">—</span> Dagmawi, founder</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <div class="px-6 py-16 rounded-3xl bg-[#E6F2F0] text-center">
      <h2 class="text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#135550]">
        Got a letter you're <em class="font-['Instrument_Serif',Georgia,serif] italic font-normal">not sure</em> about?
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-2">
        <a href="/signup" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#F2A541] text-[#0B4F4A] font-medium no-underline ">Create free account</a>
        <a href="/sample" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#0B4F4A] text-white font-medium no-underline ">See a sample letter</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <footer class="border-t border-[#e6e6e6] bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 py-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="max-w-[320px]">
        <img src="/images/tirgum-logo.svg" alt="Tirgum" class="h-9 w-auto">
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#6b6b6b] leading-normal">Official letters explained in your language, with next steps and free help nearby.</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-6 list-none m-0 p-0 font-semibold">
        <li><a href="#howitworks" class="no-underline">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a href="#privacy" class="no-underline">Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="no-underline">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/login" class="no-underline">Log in</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-5 pb-8 flex justify-between text-sm text-[#6b6b6b]">
      <span>© 2026 Tirgum</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>